; SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
; Luma Vitals memory guard: let systemd-oomd stop apps that run in a user
; namespace (Flatpak sandboxes, universal-package containers). Signalling a
; process in another user namespace needs CAP_KILL there; without it an
; enforcing machine denies the kill and the desktop keeps thrashing
; (avc: denied { kill } ... tclass=cap_userns, seen 2026-11-07).
(allow systemd_oomd_t self (cap_userns (kill)))
